---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about the Incubator at Lakeshore Studios — our digital workshop for building tools, experiments, and products.">
  <section class="section-spacing">
    <div class="container-inc">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-inc-lime font-mono text-sm mb-2">// about</p>
        <h1 class="text-display-xl mb-6">The Incubator</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-inc-silver leading-relaxed mb-12">
          A place where ideas get built, tested, and sometimes shipped.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="container-inc">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-8">
        <div class="card-dark p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-inc-white mb-4">Why an Incubator?</h2>
          <p class="text-inc-silver leading-relaxed mb-4">
            At MadeByLakeshore, we consult on design, data, and AI. But consulting is only half the picture.
            The Incubator is where we practice what we preach — building real tools with the same technologies
            we recommend to clients.
          </p>
          <p class="text-inc-silver leading-relaxed">
            Every project here teaches us something we bring back to client work. It keeps our skills sharp,
            our recommendations honest, and our curiosity fed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-dark p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-inc-white mb-4">Building in public</h2>
          <p class="text-inc-silver leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We share our projects at every stage — from rough concept to launched product. Some will succeed,
            some will pivot, and some will teach us something valuable on the way to becoming something else entirely.
          </p>
          <p class="text-inc-silver leading-relaxed">
            The build log captures the journey: what worked, what didn't, and what we learned along the way.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-dark p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-inc-white mb-4">Want to collaborate?</h2>
          <p class="text-inc-silver leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Have an idea you'd like to explore together? See a project you'd like to contribute to?
            We're always open to interesting conversations.
          </p>
          <a href="https://madebylakeshore.com/contact" class="btn-glow">
            Get in Touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
